  "row_count": 17,
  "notes": {
    "raw": "Phase changes: 485 K, transition point of $Cu_{5}FeS_{4}$ ; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 1.430$ kcal/mol.\n540 K, transition point of $Cu_{5}FeS_{4}$ ; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 0$ kcal/mol.\n1043 K, Curie temperature of Fe; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 0$ kcal/mol.\n1185 K, $\\alpha - \\gamma$ transition point of Fe; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 0.215$ kcal/mol. \nHeat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations: \n<table><tr><td>298.15-485 K:</td><td> $Cp^o$  = 48.668 + 37.088x $10^{-3}$ T - 0.906x $10^5$ T $^{-2}$ </td></tr><tr><td>485-540 K:</td><td> $H^o-H_{298}^o$  = 48.668x $10^{-3}$ T + 18.544x $10^{-6}$ T $^2$  + 0.906x $10^2$ T $^{-1}$  - 16.463 $Cp^o$  = -34.310 + 247.000x $10^{-3}$ T</td></tr><tr><td>540-1200 K:</td><td> $H^o-H_{298}^o$  = -34.310x $10^{-3}$ T + 123.500x $10^{-6}$ T $^2$  + 0.710 $Cp^o$  = 80.330 - 2.040x $10^{-3}$ T</td></tr><tr><td></td><td> $H^o-H_{298}^o$  = 80.330x $10^{-3}$ T - 1.020x $10^{-6}$ T $^2$  - 24.886</td></tr></table>\nReaction equations (kcal/mol): \n<table><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">298.15-485 K:</td><td> $\\Delta Hr^{\\circ} = -155.412 + 5.603x10^{-3}T + 7.783x10^{-6}T^{2} + 217.500T^{-1}$ </td></tr><tr><td> $\\Delta Gr^{\\circ} = -155.412 - 5.603x10^{-3}T\\ln T - 7.783x10^{-6}T^{2} + 108.750T^{-1} + 111.943x10^{-3}T$ </td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">485-540 K:</td><td> $\\Delta Hr^{\\circ} = -138.239 - 77.375x10^{-3}T + 112.739x10^{-6}T^{2} + 126.900T^{-1}$ </td></tr><tr><td> $\\Delta Gr^{\\circ} = -138.239 + 77.375x10^{-3}T\\ln T - 112.739x10^{-6}T^{2} + 63.450T^{-1} - 385.517x10^{-3}T$ </td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">540-1043 K:</td><td> $\\Delta Hr^{\\circ} = -163.835 + 37.265x10^{-3}T - 11.781x10^{-6}T^{2} + 126.900T^{-1}$ </td></tr><tr><td> $\\Delta Gr^{\\circ} = -163.835 - 37.265x10^{-3}T\\ln T + 11.781x10^{-6}T^{2} + 63.450T^{-1} + 315.907x10^{-3}T$ </td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">1043-1185 K:</td><td> $\\Delta Hr^{\\circ} = -140.274 - 6.716x10^{-3}T + 8.930x10^{-6}T^{2} - 101.600T^{-1}$ </td></tr><tr><td> $\\Delta Gr^{\\circ} = -140.274 + 6.716x10^{-3}T\\ln T - 8.930x10^{-6}T^{2} - 50.800T^{-1} + 9.362x10^{-3}T$ </td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">1185-1200 K:</td><td> $\\Delta Hr^{\\circ} = -163.888 + 31.539x10^{-3}T - 6.761x10^{-6}T^{2} + 17.400T^{-1}$ </td></tr><tr><td> $\\Delta Gr^{\\circ} = -163.888 - 31.539x10^{-3}T\\ln T + 6.761x10^{-6}T^{2} + 8.700T^{-1} + 281.403x10^{-3}T$ </td></tr></table>\nSource: Data from King (64). ",
